"│ ┌ Abandon a starting run? ─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │"
"│ │Quitting waits until the job of a new run has started, which can take     │ │"
"│ │minutes. Abandon it instead? Its pod is deleted and the run fails, as     │ │"
"│ │Ctrl-C does on the command line before the job starts.                    │ │"
